1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,850
- Please, I'm begging you, go to sleep.
- I'm trying. I'm counting Catwomen.

2
00:00:10,101 --> 00:00:12,811
(Sheldon:)She did make a fine mutant
in the X-Men movies, though.

3
00:00:12,979 --> 00:00:13,979
(Howard:)Oh, for God's sake.

4
00:00:14,147 --> 00:00:17,647
She's not my favorite of the X-Men.
In order, that'd be Wolverine, Cyclops...

5
00:00:17,817 --> 00:00:21,317
(Sheldon:)I forgot Professor X.
Professor X, Wolverine, Cyclops, Iceman...

6
00:00:21,488 --> 00:00:24,828
(Sheldon:)...then Storm, Angel, the Bea...
No, wait, Nightcrawler.

7
00:00:25,241 --> 00:00:30,331
(Sheldon:)Professor X, Nightcrawler, Wolverine,
Cyclops, Iceman, then Storm, Angel...

8
00:00:30,497 --> 00:00:31,537
[DOOR KNOCKS]

9
00:00:31,706 --> 00:00:32,746
LEONARD:
I'm coming.

10
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,880
(Leonard:)Hey.

11
00:00:36,252 --> 00:00:39,882
(Sheldon:)There he is.
There's my old buddy-bud-bud.

12
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:48,470
- What's with him?
- Koothrappali dumped him on me.

13
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:51,310
(Howard:)He couldn't get to sleep,
so I gave him a glass of milk...

14
00:00:51,476 --> 00:00:54,476
(Howard:)...with a handful
of my mom's Valium in it.

15
00:00:55,939 --> 00:01:03,019
(Howard:)But he still wouldn't shut up,
so tag, you're it.

